  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation Quality Assurance and Learning Services (EQuALS 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EQuALS 2 delivers independent quality assurance of evaluation products and provides a range of specialist evaluation and monitoring technical advice in order to improve evaluation quality and usefulness across FCDO and other government departments.The helpdesk programme provides staff from FCDO  access to a panel of evaluation consultants with expertise covering the range of ODA thematic areas and evaluation methodologies. This panel provides short term technical advice and quality assurance reviews across the programme cycle in response to the needs of programme staff.</narrative>
  </description>
